<header><p class="enc-kicker">Work / monument · song</p><h1 class="enc-title">National Anthem of the Republic of China</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates">words <a href="/years/1924">1924</a>; national anthem approved <a href="/years/1937">1937</a></span> · <a href="/centuries/20th-century">20th century</a> · Also known as 三民主義, Sānmín Zhǔyì</p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">The &quot;National Anthem of the Republic of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/china">China</a>&quot;, also known from its opening as &quot;<a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/three-principles-of-the-people">Three Principles of the People</a>&quot;, is the national anthem of the Republic of China, commonly called <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/taiwan">Taiwan</a>, and the party anthem of the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/kuomintang">Kuomintang</a>.</p></div>
